{"title":"2016 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(more_detailed_explanation_of_Solution_1)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (more detailed explanation of Solution 1)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(CREATIVE_THINKING!!!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING!!!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Which of the following numbers is not a perfect square?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/d/e9d1c6ae5ea13c8923b3d118b8292befd0e08e88.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }1^{2016}\\qquad\\textbf{(B) }2^{2017}\\qquad\\textbf{(C) }3^{2018}\\qquad\\textbf{(D) }4^{2019}\\qquad \\textbf{(E) }5^{2020}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"488\" height=\"19\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Our answer must have an odd exponent in order for it to not be a square.  Because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is a perfect square, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/2/a720d2a08d189aa70f6915d2323ad7ce2132b5c4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4^{2019}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"17\" /> is also a perfect square, so our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/8/aa8b9b6a49da8c3cf5e9d43623d29aa5275a7138.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B) }2^{2017}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"84\" height=\"32\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28more_detailed_explanation_of_Solution_1.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(more_detailed_explanation_of_Solution_1)\">Solution 2 (more detailed explanation of Solution 1)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (more detailed explanation of Solution 1)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Any even integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> can be divided into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/3/f93f5c51ea4b04b4992b003b39479f29018f6bda.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2n$\" width=\"19\" height=\"12\" /> where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is an integer as well. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/1/b81b7fcb150c04b7b6efb674d620b781a9acc1d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A), (C),}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"77\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/e/75e41e3cd48cee2c6866cfbb4386a8e99d3482f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(E)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"29\" height=\"18\" /> are immediately disqualified, as when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> is even, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/a/6faf9b7c3cd51ab962ac4236f9e87f886f5f27d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^m$\" width=\"21\" height=\"12\" /> can always be written as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/6/6768e14bd191772506a62bf8da64642c2d6b7406.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a^\\frac{m}{2})^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"48\" height=\"22\" /> as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/a/84a68e0275e5644a13caf3c18be3aa396ee544ff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a^m)^n = a^{mn}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"102\" height=\"20\" /> and vice versa. Only odd exponents are non-squares, therefore. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/e/8ee7bdef8e80ae4acedb43e873e41684ac66353a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4=2^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"48\" height=\"15\" />, which means <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/5/4e5ac998798cd63fb4a0612b263858407691e0ff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4^{2019}=(2^2)^2019=(2^{2019})^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"210\" height=\"21\" /> by the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/a/84a68e0275e5644a13caf3c18be3aa396ee544ff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a^m)^n = a^{mn}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"102\" height=\"20\" /> rule. The only option left is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/8/aa8b9b6a49da8c3cf5e9d43623d29aa5275a7138.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B) }2^{2017}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"84\" height=\"32\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/ymZQgW-cL4s?si=NbFD5ZIPgtojqEaj\">https://youtu.be/ymZQgW-cL4s?si=NbFD5ZIPgtojqEaj</a>\n</p><p>~Elijahman~\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28CREATIVE_THINKING.21.21.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(CREATIVE_THINKING!!!)\">Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING!!!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING!!!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/_zfiULRR3co\">https://youtu.be/_zfiULRR3co</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BZKzpY_pH5A\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BZKzpY_pH5A</a>   ~David\n</p><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/prtDHdc12cs\">https://youtu.be/prtDHdc12cs</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_8\" title=\"2016 AMC 8\">2016 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2016 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2016 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2016\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2016 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">F